  "notes": "No motif on Isa, Adam, or the people called to the mubahala (61:13-18); no hands on 61:20 (the Prophet's ﷺ own act). light on 59:14, two_paths for the dispute. STAGING v4: 57-58: believers praying in a prayer hall (the good deeds), prostrating on 57:6 and already sitting at 57:7; during 57:9-11 the camera moves off them onto a two_paths plate (until 58:2); they read the Book on 58:2 (As-Sa'di: a favour to the Prophet and his ummah); wheat plate for the reward (ended before 57:8), book plate for the wise reminder. 59-60 (Isa and Adam created by His command: Allah's act) stay ambient; the lamp plate was removed because it lived over 60:3. 61 (the mubahala) stays ambient: it addresses the Prophet and names families and women; no people drawn; two_paths ends before 61:23."
 },
